  "notes": [
    "PLTP and PRBB urusans are close structural twins of PT and PRZ respectively. Adding them: copy the stages array of the twin and adjust as needed.",
    "Consent, Pembangunan, Lelong moduls have no dedicated prefix in et_main — they live inside umm_*/plp_* distinguished by urusan_kod. Until that mapping is provided, those moduls show as preview-stubs.",
    "AWAM/Pra layer = tables with _p_ in the name. Internal/PLP layer = tables with _a_. The toggle in the UI filters by this."
  ],
